<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n67192" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μέτοικος</span></b> , ὁ, ἡ, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>settler from abroad, alien resident in a foreign city,
				denizen</i>, <i><span class="en">
				A.
				<u>Th.</u>
				548
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>Supp.</u>
				994
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Hdt.
				4.151
			</span></i>, etc.; esp. at Athens, <i><span class="en">
				Th.
				2.13
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				And.
				1.15
			</span></i>, etc.; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ξένος λόγῳ μ.</span>,
			opp. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐγγενής</span>, <i><span class="en">
				S.
				<u>OT</u>
				452
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Ar.
				<u>Ach.</u>
				508
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>Eq.</u>
				347
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>SIG</u>
				799.25
			</span></i> (Cyzic., <span class="entity">i A.D.</span>); <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μ. γῆς</span>
			<i>one who has settled in</i> a country, <i><span class="en">
				A.
				<u>Pers.</u>
				319
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μ. δόμων, χώρας</span>, <i><span class="en">
				Id.
				<u>Ch.</u>
				971
			</span></i> (lyr.), <i><span class="en">
				S.
				<u>OC</u>
				934
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐν τῇ τῶν πλησίον</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					And.
					1.144
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">βροτοῖς οὔτε
				&lt;νεκρὸσ&gt; νεκροῖσιν μέτοικος, οὐ ζῶσιν, οὐ
				θανοῦσιν</span>
			<i>whose home is</i> neither <i>with</i> the living nor the
			dead, <i><span class="en">
				S.
				<u>Ant.</u>
				852
			</span></i> (lyr.): metaph., of birds, as <i>sojourners</i> in the
			heavens, <i><span class="en">
				A.
				<u>Ag.</u>
				57
			</span></i> (anap.). </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>occupant of the same house with</i> another, <i><span class="en">
				<u>Sammelb.</u>
				5837
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(ii A.D.)</span>.</div>
